//| Gate_Level_BelowIBH: in RTH, true only if levelPx < IB high at kLast; false for first hour of RTH (when IB not ready). |
//| Uses g_m1Rates[kLast].time for session (GetSessionForCandleTime: ON | RTH | sleep). |
